Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:57:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 400/402] Part: the web page's positions as Int16 and normals
 as Int8; simplified parts as 8-sided prisms without normals

Still over 30 MB with bolts simplified (400 plain bolts in one part are
few triangles each but many). Positions are written in the box of all as
Int16 (error box/65534, 0.06 mm for 4 m), normals as Int8: some 40% of
the float32 page. Simplified parts are 8-sided prisms or boxes with no
normals (the page shades them flat).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
